WEBVTT

00:00:58.954 --> 00:01:02.537
I'd grown five inches
and done some 20,000 pushups

00:01:02.537 --> 00:01:03.912
in eight months,

00:01:03.912 --> 00:01:07.246
and the night before the crash,
I delighted in my new body,

00:01:07.246 --> 00:01:09.163
playing basketball with friends

00:01:09.163 --> 00:01:11.288
into the wee hours of a May morning.

00:01:11.663 --> 00:01:14.496
I palmed the ball in my large right hand,

00:01:14.538 --> 00:01:17.871
and when that hand reached the rim,
I felt invincible.

00:01:18.788 --> 00:01:22.038
I was off in the bus to get the pizza
I'd won on the court.

00:01:22.829 --> 00:01:24.538
I didn't see Abed coming.

00:01:25.038 --> 00:01:26.204
From my seat,

00:01:26.204 --> 00:01:28.579
I was looking up
at a stone town on a hilltop,

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:30.204
bright in the noontime sun,